# Mochaguard environment variables
#
# All variables below are OPTIONAL. Mochaguard's risk engine is fully
# deterministic and works with zero configuration. If ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is
# left blank, the "Why is it risky?" and Risk Q&A features automatically use
# the built-in deterministic explanation templates instead of AI — the app
# never breaks or blocks on a missing key.

# Optional: enables the AI explanation layer (natural-language summaries,
# risk Q&A) via the Anthropic API. Used only server-side in
# src/app/api/explain/route.ts — never exposed to the browser.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
